WEBVTT

00:00:13.905 --> 00:00:23.215
<v Speaker 1>Hello and welcome to the 2007 World Championship Award Ceremony. Assisting me today will be the head judge of today's event, Ricardo Tessitore</v>

00:00:24.065 --> 00:00:30.275
<v Speaker 1>1st, the 2007 Rookie of the Year from Japan, Yuuya Watanabe.</v>

00:01:00.015 --> 00:01:07.465
<v Speaker 1>Introducing the 2007 Player of the Year from Japan, Tomohiro Saito.</v>

00:01:25.615 --> 00:01:33.105
<v Speaker 1>He had previously given award the team finalists for 2007 World Championships Team Austria. Congratulations</v>

00:01:36.615 --> 00:01:49.405
<v Speaker 1>and now introducing the 2007 team World Champions from Switzerland, Team Switzerland, Manuel Booker, Christoph Huber, Nickel Bonnie and Raphael Ginari.</v>

00:02:06.245 --> 00:02:11.515
<v Speaker 1>Once again, let's hear it for Team Switzerland winning $12,000 this weekend.</v>

00:02:20.555 --> 00:02:28.245
<v Speaker 1>In the main event competition previously awarded prizes 4th place from Japan Kataro Otsuka.</v>

00:02:45.405 --> 00:02:48.815
<v Speaker 1>And 3rd place from France. Gabrielle Massive.</v>

00:03:02.685 --> 00:03:03.215
<v Speaker 1>Go ahead game,</v>

