00:03:37.975 --> 00:03:47.305
<v Speaker 1>And now it is my pleasure to introduce the 2007 World Champion winning $40,000 from Israel, Uri Peleg.</v>

00:04:00.005 --> 00:04:05.165
<v Speaker 1>One more time, let's hear it for the 2007 world champion Uri Peleg.</v>

00:04:18.355 --> 00:04:28.105
<v Speaker 1>I'd like to thank all the staff, players and judges for making this World Championship such a great success. We'll see you in February from Pro Tour Kuala Lumpur. Thank you and good night.</v>

